<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-24T14:02:19.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:02:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in South Kashmir launched counter-insurgency operations in multiple villages after terrorist presence was reported, while the Srinagar police chief chaired a high-level security review on intelligence sharing and valley domination. In Manipur, tribal students intensified agitation demanding scholarship releases and a tragic ambulance collision killed a pregnant woman, and a hooch-related fire claimed 17 lives. The Chhattisgarh government recovered a Maoist weapon dump in the Bijapur forests and killed a suspected KCP cadre, and Lateef Bhat was killed in Kulgam. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE45UkYzTGZfeXBvMGNVcC1wbFdMdUlzTzZvSlRTSS04Q2dGNU9fM1pvbkVBSnpVVTVLX1VXVE5xY2ViRTQwRW1BUENmT19VUU1KQlNwOGhKVHE?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNdkJKdk9aRXZIZzdLODVlY1paNG5pT1NpRGlPVnBuakNpSVpXdEZ0Q3FpMUpxaFYwekoyMTRRenNWMm15dEIzN0xOUGszdUZGQ1RYRTA5aWxXWndJcGI4WUJXbFJvN1I3czBlNkowY3BTTV84dGRuMWpiOEI1UTZ6TGVBYzNaYXNtWjlyM3ZBZlYwdlV4V1Z5Q3UtWnNmbnkxdjhBYUVVRldfNVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hindudayashankar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNSEJtYWJ5Q1B4Rld6Q1hkWGxoQU5nc19kZElIZEFmd2lHaThyeW92bm1QZi1seFlZTE9zazFiUEF6ZlVzZkhEc0lzcVplQ2VDVmZPMWw1T19oVmJYYWt6TjJjUGNZR3I2YTdoT1hnR0xCMlNmWktwZEdTQVY2dFJlMmNsVUltQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOcEttZnhvNmRSMEtzR2FPSDJ1NkVFdDJfRUdHckVlaldpN3VsZU9QMTgyOW9Ccm9LdnhrQ1BKM0tDekpFRGZDUzg1LU93cVVZTUZMaDZ2YlQ3Vm04cFU2ay13TDBzeTdObEM2OGt0OFUwN21Ldk1FbEdvVTAxcjFGSC1Ba29ZR3gzazRkMGMwdy1kUl9GaHl1eU12VEpDTmhXQUkxTzBMRWdQLXlRYno5VHZrSVlMQ3lUUjJnWGlldlI?oc=5&quot;&gt;| Associated Pre